   <template v-if="section==='internships'">
    <section class="its-wrap its-section"><p class="its-eyebrow">Learn with purpose</p><h2>Two starting points. One supportive team.</h2><p class="intern-intro">Our Student Training Program offers supervised, hands-on learning for students in approved academic practicum or internship programs. Enter at the stage that fits your educational requirements and prior experience.</p><div class="intern-two"><article class="intern-card"><span class="intern-step">01 · Practicum</span><h3>Build your foundation.</h3><p>Begin practical training in a structured, supervised environment. Observe, assist, and develop foundational skills with guidance from experienced clinicians.</p></article><article class="intern-card"><span class="intern-step">02 · Internship</span><h3>Deepen your experience.</h3><p>For students who have completed practicum or have equivalent experience, internship offers deeper immersion in approved clinical activities and opportunities to refine your skills.</p></article></div></section>
    <section id="positions-available" class="its-wrap its-section"><p class="its-eyebrow">Paid practicum & internship</p><h2>Positions Available</h2><p class="intern-intro"><strong>Rolling admission</strong> — available for Fall, Spring, or Summer placements.</p><div class="intern-two"><article class="intern-card"><Icon name="school"/><h3>Colorado Springs</h3><p class="intern-position-count">3–5 positions</p><p>Practicum and internship placements in school-based and approved office settings.</p></article><article class="intern-card"><Icon name="mountain"/><h3>Denver</h3><p class="intern-position-count">2–3 positions</p><p>Practicum and internship placements in school-based and approved office settings.</p></article></div><p class="intern-pay"><strong>$24–$30 per hour of direct service.</strong> Both practicum and internship placements are paid. The rate applies to direct-service hours; placement details and other training terms are confirmed in your written agreement.</p></section>
