    <section class="its-wrap its-section"><div class="intern-two"><div><p class="its-eyebrow">A learning experience with real purpose</p><h2>What you’ll take part in.</h2><p>Activities grow with your training level, academic requirements, supervisor approval, and client needs.</p><ul class="intern-checklist"><li v-for="item in duties" :key="item"><Icon name="shield"/><span>{{item}}</span></li></ul></div><aside class="intern-card intern-expectations"><h3>Education comes first.</h3><p>The program prioritizes learning, ethical practice, and client safety. Students work under supervision and within the scope approved by ITSCO and their academic institution.</p><p>Students do not practice independently, represent themselves as licensed providers, or bill independently. Clinical decisions and documentation require the designated supervisor’s review and approval.</p><router-link :to="path('supervisors')">Meet supervisors & mentors →</router-link></aside></div></section>
