   <section id="intern-apply" class="intern-apply its-wrap its-section"><div><p class="its-eyebrow">Your next step</p><h2>Practicum/Internship application</h2><p>Ready to explore a placement with ITSCO? Apply through our current practicum/internship listing.</p><p v-if="jobsLoading" role="status">Loading the practicum/internship application…</p><template v-else-if="internshipJobs.length"><div v-for="job in internshipJobs" :key="job.applicationPublicKey" class="intern-job"><h3>{{job.title}}</h3><a class="its-button" :href="buildPublicIntakeUrl(job.applicationPublicKey)">Practicum/Internship application <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div></template><div v-else><p role="status">{{jobsError?'We couldn’t load the application right now. Open our careers page or try again.':'There isn’t a published internship application right now. Contact our team about upcoming placements.'}}</p><button v-if="jobsError" class="its-button its-outline" @click="loadJobs">Try again</button><router-link class="its-button" to="/careers/itsco">View careers →</router-link></div><p class="intern-small">Program dates, hours, direct-service pay, classification, insurance, and placement requirements are governed by your academic affiliation and written training agreement. Participation does not guarantee employment.</p></div><aside class="intern-card"><Icon name="chat"/><h3>Let’s talk about your next chapter.</h3><a class="its-button" href="#contact-rachel">Contact Rachel →</a><p>Questions about your academic program or placement? We’d like to hear from you.</p><router-link class="its-button its-outline" :to="path('contact')">Contact our team →</router-link><router-link class="its-text-button" :to="path('internship-fair')">Open the internship fair display →</router-link></aside></section>
